\r\n /* Style Definitions */\r\n table.MsoNormalTable\r\n	{mso-style-name:\"Table Normal\";\r\n	mso-tstyle-rowband-size:0;\r\n	mso-tstyle-colband-size:0;\r\n	mso-style-noshow:yes;\r\n	mso-style-priority:99;\r\n	mso-style-parent:\"\";\r\n	mso-padding-alt:0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\r\n	mso-para-margin-top:0cm;\r\n	mso-para-margin-right:0cm;\r\n	mso-para-margin-bottom:8.0pt;\r\n	mso-para-margin-left:0cm;\r\n	line-height:107%;\r\n	mso-pagination:widow-orphan;\r\n	font-size:11.0pt;\r\n	font-family:\"Calibri\",sans-serif;\r\n	mso-ascii-font-family:Calibri;\r\n	mso-ascii-theme-font:minor-latin;\r\n	mso-hansi-font-family:Calibri;\r\n	mso-hansi-theme-font:minor-latin;\r\n	mso-fareast-language:EN-US;}\r\n</style>\r\n<![endif]-->\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:\r\njustify;line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-fareast-language:IN\">Dengan\r\nhormat, </span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:\r\njustify;line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-fareast-language:IN\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:\r\njustify;line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-fareast-language:IN\">Sehubungan\r\ndengan penyelenggaraan Hari Pers Nasional (HPN) 2026 yang akan dilaksanakan 6\r\n-9 Februari 2026 di Provinsi Banten dengan puncak acara pada 9 Februari 2026,\r\nPersatuan Wartawan Indonesia (PWI) Kabupaten Banyuasin berencana akan berangkat\r\nsebanyak 40 orang. </span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:\r\njustify;line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-fareast-language:IN\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:\r\njustify;line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-fareast-language:IN\">Kehadiran\r\nperwakilan PWI Banyuasin pada agenda nasional ini bertujuan untuk meningkatkan\r\nprofesionalisme jurnalistik, memperkuat jejaring dengan PWI pusat dan daerah\r\nlain, serta mempromosikan capaian pembangunan Kabupaten Banyuasin di bawah kepemimpinan\r\nBupati Bapak Dr. H. Askolani, SH., MH dan Wakil Bupati -<span style=\"mso-spacerun:yes\">&nbsp; </span>Ibu Netta Indian, SP</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:\r\njustify;line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-fareast-language:IN\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:\r\njustify;line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-fareast-language:IN\">Sebagai\r\norganisasi profesi yang menjalin sinergi erat dengan Pemerintah Kabupaten\r\nBanyuasin, kami mengajukan permohonan bantuan biaya perjalanan dinas\r\n(transportasi PP Banyuasin-Banten, akomodasi, dan konsumsi) dengan rincian\r\nsebagai berikut&nbsp; <i>(terlampir)</i></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:\r\njustify;line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-fareast-language:IN\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto;\r\ntext-align:justify;line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;\r\nfont-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\r\nmso-ansi-language:EN-ID;mso-fareast-language:IN\" lang=\"EN-ID\">Atas perhatian dan dukungan\r\nBapak kami ucapkan terima kasih.</span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;\r\nfont-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\r\nmso-fareast-language:IN\"></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n', NULL, 'Wardoyo, S.I.Kom', 'Deni Arianto', '2026-09-03 07:23:01', '2026-09-03 07:23:01', '7f0c8ec3-0498-4cdb-b916-a17ef22564b5', 'TERVERIFIKASI & SAH', 'a7ad68810c0bb6be40764754668ca418018a1d2e9a7b45e1bfecfaec9c488808');
